        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions STR3SMTSS4, Stainless Steel Sutter Ruler Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Stainless Steel Sutter Ruler Pull is available in a few finishes. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The Mitered Sutter Stainless Steel Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors--making it the perfect pull for commercial or residential use. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Sutter Series 3 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-STR03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262331\"><b>First Impressions STR3SMTSS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>STR3012SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 11-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>STR3024SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 23-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>STR3036SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 35-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
