                "title": "Mitered Sutter Stainless Steel Pull",
                "description": "This Stainless Steel Sutter Ruler Pull is available in 5 finishes. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The Mitered Sutter Stainless Steel Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors--making it the perfect pull for commercial or residential use.",
